Abstract = {Two new species Paraconularia are described from rocks of lower-middle
   Permian (Kungurian to Capitanian) age in the Las Delicias Formation,
   northeastern of Torreon, into the State of Coahuila, Mexico. These
   species are the first conulariids reported from the Permian of Mexico,
   and they have affinities with faunas of the Grandian Province from the
   Palaeoequatorial Realm.},
