Abstract = {In this document, we will show the procedure and results of the quality
   control test in intraoral X-rays machines, belongs to the Clinica de
   Imagenologia part of the Facultad de Odontologia of the Universidad
   Nacional Autonoma de Mexico in Ciudad Universitaria. These quality
   control tests have been perform following the recommendations of the
   ``Protocolo Espanol de Control de Calidad en Radiodiagnostico{''}.
   Results obtained during the measurements shows that the intraoral X-rays
   machines works in optimal conditions for the radiological images
   collecting, and it would not present any risk for patients and the
   equipment operators, because the data obtained in all quality control
   tests are within normal limits set by the international organizations in
   relation to nuclear safety and radiation protection.},
